# No Cursor attribution in this repo

This repository must not show Cursor, Cursor Agent, or AI tool attribution anywhere public.

## Forbidden unless explicitly requested by the user in the current message

- `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>` or any co-author trailer
- Any file under `.git/hooks/`
- Comments or docs saying "Generated by Cursor", "Built with AI", etc.
- Commit, push, or force-push without explicit user permission
- Rewriting git author/committer to anything other than the user's GitHub identity

## Required before any git commit

1. Confirm the user asked for a commit in this turn
2. Inspect the full commit message; strip all co-author and tool credit lines
3. Use the repo's configured git user only
4. Do not push unless the user explicitly asks

## Required after accidental attribution

If co-author lines or hooks were added, remove them and rewrite history before push. Tell the user what was found and fixed.
